<section class="bg-surface/60" data-ruler-section="Train">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 text-center sm:py-20 lg:px-8 lg:py-24">
    <p class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm">
      <span class="badge-new">Catalog</span>
      <a href="/models" class="text-link text-sm font-medium text-text">Browse the open models we fine-tune →</a>
    </p>
    <h1 class="heading-display mt-6 text-[2.85rem] sm:text-[3.25rem] lg:text-[3.85rem]">
      Artificial <span class="font-elsh-heart text-primary">intelligence</span>, trained on your data.
    </h1>
    <p class="lead mx-auto mt-5 max-w-xl text-center">
      We fine-tune <span class="text-instrument">Llama</span>, <span class="text-instrument">Qwen</span>, <span class="text-instrument">FLUX</span>, and Stable Diffusion on your data, with evaluation, license review, and deployment in <span class="text-instrument">AWS</span>, <span class="text-instrument">Modal</span>, or your own <span class="text-instrument">VPC</span>.
    </p>
    <p class="copy-bridge mx-auto mt-4 max-w-md text-center">
      Milestone-based delivery, from dataset review to handoff of the trained weights.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a href="/get-started" class="btn-primary">
        Start project
        <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a href="/contact" class="text-link text-sm">Talk to us →</a>
    </div>

    <ul class="hero-highlights mt-14 grid gap-8 border-t border-border pt-10 text-left sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-6 sm:text-center">
      <li>
        <p class="section-kicker">What we train</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Language, vision-language, image, video, embeddings, and speech: open-weight models you can host.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p class="section-kicker">How we train</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          <span class="text-instrument">SFT</span>, <span class="text-instrument">LoRA</span>, <span class="text-instrument">QLoRA</span>, preference tuning, and diffusion adapters, with versioned configs.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p class="section-kicker">What you get</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Weights, evaluation reports, and deployment guides for your environment, not lock-in on our infra.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
